ickets\n- The playback-controller ticket (subscriptions on close) will touch\n  closePlayer near the new `dispatch('playerClosed')` line.\nEOF\nnpm test > /tmp/t07.log 2>&1; echo exit $?; grep -E \"^# (tests|pass|fail)|^not ok\" /tmp/t07.log | head"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01GAxUKTSWa2dzM4cJNrtRrt":{"cwd":"/Users/nick/code/webtorrent-desktop.memory-leaks-07-leaving-player-cancels-external-player-wait"}}}
